            "payload": "tree 1fc972d6df8d957ddb98a8ee562caaed5c3344ce\nparent a54b0ef94e2301f7d9612f0854d925941954d9dd\nauthor Arbiter <96613937+EnterTheArcane@users.noreply.github.com> 1768341010 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1768341010 -0800\n\nRemove missing symlink from DirectXShaderCompilerDxc runtime dependencies (#295)\n\nDirectXShaderCompilerDxc lists `libdxcompiler.3.7.dylib` as a runtime\ndependency, but this artifact is never created during the build. My\nguess is that it used to be a symlink to libdxcompiler.dylib that was\nremoved at some point.\n\nThis bumps the macOS build of DirectXShaderCompilerDxc to rev4 and\nremoves the bad reference.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: EnterTheArcane <96613937+EnterTheArcane@users.noreply.github.com>",
